E4: WHEN EC-USER, a name first seen inside
  WHEN EC-USER: EC-USER-NEW                    
E4: resumed after the raise
E5: WHEN EC-ALL, then a new user name after END-PERFORM
E5: no USE above
E6: a name on before PERFORM WITH LOCATION keeps no location
  USE EC-USER-A, location [ ]
E8: WHEN takes AT END; USE AFTER ERROR ignored
  WHEN EC-I-O-AT-END
E8: after read, fs=10
E11: WHEN EC-I-O FILE f3 before WHEN EC-I-O-AT-END
  WHEN EC-I-O FILE f3
E7: on for all files, off for f1: the implicit TURN for f1
  WHEN EC-I-O-AT-END
E7: after read, fs=10
